WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.084
(Nina screaming)

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:04.504
♪

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:10.219
(Nina) Hi, Millie!

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:12.262
(Millie) Hi! Mrs. Winchester.

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:13.597
- Oh, please call me Nina.

00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:14.848
Come on in.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.059
So, why do you want this job?

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:19.394
- I just really enjoy
being a housemaid.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:20.604
For the right families...

00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:21.647
...of course.

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:23.774
- You know this is a
live-in position, right?

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:27.444
(banging on door)

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:28.987
Ta-da!

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:31.406
This is your room.
What do you think?

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:32.574
- It's perfect.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.158
- Okay, good.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:36.870
♪

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.247
(Nina) So, would you like
the grand tour?

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:41.792
See what you're
getting yourself into?

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:47.422
The job is mostly cleaning,
organizing, some light cooking.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:50.217
(Andrew) Hello.

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:51.677
- Millie's going to be living
with us.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:53.804
- She's going to live with us?

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:54.972
- Andrew, I told you that!

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:57.099
She'd be part of the family.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:02.854
I want you to feel safe here.

00:01:03.397 --> 00:01:04.273
- I do.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:06.900
- For your door.

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:12.239
You're a lifesaver.

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:14.700
I don't know what I'd
do without you...

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:16.994
...Millie.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:24.251
♪

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:25.127
- I need this job.

00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:27.004
I can't lose it.

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:28.130
I, I do not want to go back.

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.723
(Nina screaming)

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:42.060
♪

00:02:07.586 --> 00:02:09.880
- I have a really good
feeling about this, Millie.

00:02:10.339 --> 00:02:11.006
- Me too.

00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:12.758
- Okay, I'll be in touch.

